### Animation Quality
9. Reload the page and watch the hero entrance animation — it should feel smooth (no jank, no layout shift). Scroll slowly through About and Skills — animations should trigger once when each section enters ~30% of the viewport and not replay on scroll back up (`viewport: { once: true }`).

### Link Behavior
10. Click "View Projects" in hero — should smooth-scroll (even if the target section doesn't exist yet, it should not throw an error or navigate away). Click "Download Resume" — should open a link (placeholder is fine). Social icons should open in new tabs (`target="_blank"`, `rel="noopener noreferrer"`).

